ou battle with that pulled pork. You look determined with that cleaver in your hand. Would you like a drink?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would do with a glass of wine, please."}, {"time": "19000", "image": "engenn6le16ob07re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. There you go. That should take the edge off. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Here they come! Get the door!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm going! Don't freak out!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:You'll handle the guests! I'm going to put the finishing touches on the poutine and the pulled pork."}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn6le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey guys! Nice of you to come!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: Hi. I'm Luther. Vanessa invited me over.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, you're the saxophonist she told me about. I see you brought your saxophone, too!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: Yeah. I always carry it with me. You never know what will happen at a party!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That is true. Can I get you a bottle of beer? A can of soda?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: Beer would be great, thank you."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Time to Eat"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many ways to talk about the future. Generally, there are four verbs you can use, each specific to a particular situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Function</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will + infinitive</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">be going to + infinitive</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">intention</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I'll give you a ride to the shop.</span><br><br>(decided at the time of speaking: spontaneous offers, promises, decisions)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I can't help you on Saturday. I'm going to help my girlfriend move into her new apartment  .</span><br><br>(decided before the time of speaking, but not yet fully planned)\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">prediction</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, I think you'll find this book very interesting.</span><br><br>(based on personal judgment, opinion or intuition)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My sister is going to have a baby.</span><br><br>(bsed on present evidence or the predicted event is very near and is sure to happen)\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">arangements</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The cooker stops in five minutes.\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm flying to Paris on the 23rd of this month.</span><br><br>(plans and arragements have been made)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The boat leaves at 7 a.m. every morning.</span><br><br>(this is a regularly scheduled departure)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely.<br><br>Remember to  use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br><ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026 </li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Would you like \u2026 ?</li><li>Can I get you \u2026 ?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li><li> I guess that could ...</li><li> That would be \u2026</li><li> I would ...</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you like a drink? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I would do with a glass of wine, please. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can I get you a bottle of beer? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Beer would be great, thank you."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hold the fort"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take care of something temporarily "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to hold the fort while you battle with that pulled pork."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use before your party starts."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to battle "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to handle; to resist something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to battle with that pulled pork!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cleaver "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large knife used to cut meat "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This cleaver is very useful to chop meat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "determined"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having made a decision and resolved not to change it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You look very determined with that cleaver in your hand."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take the edge off "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reduce the effect of something unpleasant  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A glass of wine should take the edge off that stress."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to freak out "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to become irrationally nervous "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll get the door. Don't freak out!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the finishing touch "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the final detail completing a piece of work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to put the finishing touches on the poutine and the pulled pork."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob07aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le16ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find information on a professional kitchen in a restaurant or a hotel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out about the different items and utensils used in the kitchen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out how much food is prepared in a professional kitchen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a description of the kitchen (10-12 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your description aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about how to prepare food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about amounts and quantities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read a description aloud."}]}]}